{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Role chain & workflow\n`SUPER ADMIN → ADMIN → SELLER → EMPLOYEE`\nSource: `docs/ROADMAP.md` · `/todo` · `/todo-sync`\n**Next:** §6a A1 IDOR activate\nFull: A→B→C→D · one fix → test → next","x":0,"y":0,"width":1680,"height":120},
		{"id":"sec_1","type":"text","text":"## §1 Super Admin\n**Status: PARTIAL** (17/18)\n\n☐ Reset pwd by emp ID/mobile\n\n☑ Top card: product list → config\n\n☑ Add Product UI = Admin screen\n\n☑ Add Product = name + model\n\n☑ All WH/shops/staff\n\n☑ Manage warehouses\n\n☑ Stock any WH\n\n☑ Adjust any shop\n\n☑ Oversee Admins\n\n☑ Sell + accept\n\n☑ PDF all day/wk/mo\n\n☑ GPS all checked-in\n\n☑ Product cards → config\n\n☑ Add product flow\n\n☑ Loc detail + Sales PDF\n\n☑ Employee list & GPS\n\n☑ Activity filters\n\n☑ Add shop + warehouse admin","x":240,"y":140,"width":240,"height":960,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"sec_2","type":"text","text":"## §2 Admin\n**Status: DONE** (8/8)\n\n☑ Own shop only\n\n☑ Add shop no WH\n\n☑ Own staff/stock\n\n☑ Sell + accept\n\n☑ Manage staff\n\n☑ Bills via §5\n\n☑ PDF shop day/wk/mo\n\n☑ GPS shop checked-in","x":500,"y":140,"width":240,"height":420,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sec_3","type":"text","text":"## §3 Seller\n**Status: DONE** (5/5)\n\n☑ Bill/history/returns\n\n☑ Accept shipment\n\n☑ Re-scope own stock\n\n☑ Staff = Admin chain\n\n☑ Use §5 upgrades","x":760,"y":140,"width":240,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sec_4","type":"text","text":"## §4 Employee\n**Status: DONE** (7/7)\n\n☑ Check-in/out\n\n☑ Location stock\n\n☑ No accept ship\n\n☑ Create bill\n\n☑ Same serial rules\n\n☑ No SA/Admin UI\n\n☑ Off-site via §5","x":1020,"y":140,"width":240,"height":380,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sec_done","type":"text","text":"## Already done\n**Status: DONE**\n\n☑ Inventory+ledger\n\n☑ Stock/locations\n\n☑ Ship flow\n\n☑ Seller bill\n\n☑ Emp attendance\n\n☑ OpenAPI","x":1280,"y":140,"width":220,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sec_0","type":"text","text":"## §0 Roles foundation\n**Status: DONE** (4/4)\n\n☑ 4 roles chain\n\n☑ API + Flutter gates\n\n☑ Parent shop links\n\n☑ Hide/Bypass OTP","x":-80,"y":160,"width":220,"height":290,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"flow","type":"text","text":"## Audit build order\n\n6a → 6b → 6c → 6d\n\nA1…A7 IDOR\nB1…B10 stock\nC1…C8 flutter\nD1…D7 ponytail\n\nOne → you test → next","x":1440,"y":560,"width":240,"height":320},
		{"id":"sec_6a","type":"text","text":"## §6a IDOR\n**Status: NOT DONE** (0/7)\n\n☐ A1 activate shop-scope\n\n☐ A2 adjustInventory scope\n\n☐ A3 removeUnit access\n\n☐ A4 inventory transfer scope\n\n☐ A5 sales history sellerId\n\n☐ A6 history/verify/location\n\n☐ A7 legacy cancel scope","x":-100,"y":620,"width":260,"height":420,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"sec_6b","type":"text","text":"## §6b Stock/return\n**Status: NOT DONE** (0/10)\n\n☐ B1 shipment cancel\n\n☐ B2 return restock\n\n☐ B3 emp/admin returns\n\n☐ B4 atomic unit claim\n\n☐ B5 stockQuantity\n\n☐ B6 return money\n\n☐ B7 kill dual transfers\n\n☐ B8 SA ship by location\n\n☐ B9 ledger honesty\n\n☐ B10 SA qty vs list","x":260,"y":620,"width":280,"height":560,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"sec_6c","type":"text","text":"## §6c Flutter+smoke\n**Status: NOT DONE** (0/8)\n\n☐ C1 service CREDIT\n\n☐ C2 rent CREDIT\n\n☐ C3 seller+emp history\n\n☐ C4 serial scrap confirm\n\n☐ C5 PDF amountPaid\n\n☐ C6 rent fee ≤ deposit\n\n☐ C7 E2E smoke\n\n☐ C8 GPS on shift only","x":620,"y":620,"width":260,"height":480,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"sec_6d","type":"text","text":"## §6d Ponytail\n**Status: NOT DONE** (0/7)\n\n☐ D1 delete legacy transfers\n\n☐ D2 delete StockRequest\n\n☐ D3 delete dead OTP/SMS\n\n☐ D4 delete inventory history\n\n☐ D5 drop EmpActivityLog\n\n☐ D6 drop firebase_token\n\n☐ D7 shrink pass-throughs","x":960,"y":620,"width":280,"height":420,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"sec_6","type":"text","text":"## §6 Full audit\n**Status: NOT DONE** (0/32)\n\nPDF + ponytail\nA7+B10+C8+D7\n\nSay go A1","x":1280,"y":620,"width":220,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"sec_opt","type":"text","text":"## Optional product\n**Status: NOT DONE** (0/3)\n\n☐ Loc↔loc move\n\n☐ Stock request app\n\n☐ Attendance hist","x":1280,"y":880,"width":220,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"sec_5a","type":"text","text":"## §5a Harden\n**Status: DONE** (4/4)\n\n☑ Bill validation\n\n☑ WhatsApp on sale\n\n☑ Print OS dialog\n\n☑ Print after sale","x":-100,"y":1100,"width":260,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sec_5b","type":"text","text":"## §5b OTP\n**Status: DONE** (4/4)\n\n☑ Send + verify\n\n☑ Flutter helper\n\n☑ Login first\n\n☑ Reuse screens","x":260,"y":1100,"width":240,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"sec_5c","type":"text","text":"## §5c Bill types\n**Status: DONE** (8/8)\n\n☑ Scrap old+new\n\n☑ Mechanic price\n\n☑ Check 2W/4W\n\n☑ Charging\n\n☑ Jumpstart\n\n☑ Inverter ~₹1k\n\n☑ Rent deposit\n\n☑ Rent refund","x":600,"y":1100,"width":240,"height":420,"color":"4"}
